From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:37:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(world): refresh connected doors and bed colors

Bedrock can change a door lower half without updating its upper half, and a bed color can change while the base block runtime ID stays the same. Derive the upper door open state from the lower half, emit its Java update, and recompute block-entity-derived block states on repeated updates.
